            "body": "I've also been looking into some URI/path issues this week, including LSP, but hadn't noticed this one. It started with digging into some helpers used by `fix_fname/vim_FullName...`, such as `vim_isAbsName/path_with_url/path_has_drive_letter...`, with eye toward cleanup and refining the logic. I’m still tracing how they've evolved over the past few years, I guess there may be some overlap with the potential solution here.\n\n",
